# Warehouse Management System (WMS)

A Warehouse Management System designed to streamline warehouse operations, improve inventory accuracy, and simplify order processing.

## Project Overview

This project focuses on developing a centralized system to manage warehouse activities, including receiving, inventory management, storage, order processing, picking, packing, shipping, and returns.

## Key Features

- Inventory and stock management
- Goods receiving and quality inspection
- Order processing and fulfillment
- Picking, packing, and shipping management
- Returns handling
- Manager dashboard and reporting
- Barcode scanner support and RFID pilot
- ERP and accounting system integration
- User roles and access management

## Planned Technologies

- **Backend:** PHP / Laravel
- **Database:** MySQL 8
- **Frontend:** HTML, CSS, Bootstrap
- **Mobile Application:** Android
- **Integration:** REST APIs

## Project Objectives

- Improve inventory accuracy.
- Reduce order fulfillment time.
- Minimize stock errors and misplaced items.
- Improve warehouse productivity.
- Provide real-time inventory information and reports.

## Project Scope

- Single mid-size warehouse
- Up to 50 concurrent users
- Approximately 10,000 active inventory items

## Project Management

- **Course:** Project Management 495
- **Duration:** 26 Working Weeks
- **Estimated Budget:** BDT 3,080,000

## Project Status

Academic project — planning and system design.

